{"data":{"body":"**[P2] Move ON_CHANGE exports out of checkpoint callbacks**\n\nThis hook runs during synchronized checkpoint processing, before polling completion and checkpoint cleanup. `emit()` performs exporter I/O and flushing synchronously, so a slow S3 or CloudWatch call can stall durable operation progress and cause invocation timeouts. Queue immutable/coalesced snapshots here, export asynchronously, and drain them from the awaited `onInvocationEnd`; add a delayed-exporter lifecycle test.","comment_node_id":"PRRC_kwDOQwbyFc7obJwX","finding_digest":"bc70e659378e613de7bdb3b2633e5192cc833438fddfe77f4a591b9e4288a471","finding_id":"arf_v1_xryomwjxrzqt3z55wozggpsrsl","finding_key":"insight-plugin/workflowinsight.java::insightplugin.emit::checkpoint-hook-blocking","identity_key":"insight-plugin/workflowinsight.java::insightplugin.emit::checkpoint-hook-blocking","line":141,"observation_digest":"06fe15e3ba5cb11abc50b09a28582f275f45af9297da64ca023d835ba820fe65","observation_id":"aro_v1_a37bly52lsyrvpcqwcncqwbpe5","path":"insight-plugin/src/main/java/software/amazon/lambda/durable/insight/WorkflowInsight.java","prior_finding_id":"arf_v1_xryomwjxrzqt3z55wozggpsrsl","published_at":"2026-08-31T23:44:04Z","review_id":"arr_v1_tayk6qge2h3e74wst5kjjjd6wi","reviewed_base_sha":"391d78894ba4e215c07a88dcc3ce20288f41d405","reviewed_head_sha":"24e28b812198c4b065174ba4b7f7600305deb4ae","reviewer":"codex","start_line":141,"suggestion_id":""},"pull_request":{"number":661},"record_id":"art_v1_ackcmlfy7l6qhrmrxp2h52a7sz","record_type":"finding_observed","recorded_at":"2026-08-31T23:44:04Z","repository":{"full_name":"aws/aws-durable-execution-sdk-java","id":1124528661},"schema_version":1}
